{"id":"n93416-1-8","stage":5,"title":"펄럭이다 · 飘扬","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93416-1-8-1","ko":"학교에서 무슨 행사를 하나 봐요.","zh":"看来学校里正在举办什么活动呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"학교에서","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교에서","audio":"/audio/9285b891be0b7c5031dc.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"행사를","meaning":"活动，仪式，典礼","explanation":"행사：活动，仪式，典礼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"행사","audio":"/audio/9fbe110d36cda8cf2d98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72482","senseId":"1","lemma":"행사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행사를","audio":"/audio/25300fc8d0535d7e5cc2.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"表示想法或推测。","explanation":"하다：表示想法或推测；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐요","audio":"/audio/fc7dc158d915635d6cbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciatio